      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PEMBETON (2) battled away to finish sixth at Pinjarra last time out over 2013m, and before that he was a game fourth over this trip at Bunbury. That form is good enough for him to win a race in this area. PRINCE OF BONDI (1) is racing consistently and looks close to another win after a strong third over this course and distance last start. He has enough ability to be competitive again. BILLY THE BOSS (3) looks hard to hold out after a solid second over 1400m here last start. He has now recorded 4 placings from 12 runs and should be right in the finish again. BATISTA (4) has failed to fire at his past couple of starts, including an eighth here last time, but the extra 200m will suit him, and we give him another chance. RACY RASCAL (5) showed improvement last start when finishing not far off the money in fifth over 1400m. The longer trip could suit and he appeals as an each-way chance.",
